{"server":"tw","storyId":"act15mini_level_act15mini_st03","groupId":"act15mini","stageId":null,"title":"樹影幢幢","storyCode":"","avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act15mini/level_act15mini_st03.txt","sourceHash":"ba2f181da15880ab98dc657f63a1167c57fbb92eb1470d2771085afced775e73","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"30_ex1_snowmount"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"吸氣——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"吐氣——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來，吃顆這個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好——好酸......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至少不難吃吧，習慣就好啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來，還有這個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦嗚——嗚？這個果子，怎麼是空心的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像泡沫一樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們當地人就叫它“泡沫”，吃起來是沒什麼感覺，但對於上山的人來說卻是必備的好東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在有沒有覺得舒服些了，頭還痛嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔——沒事了，這些水果比治高原反應的藥還好用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道它是怎麼起效果的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道，這樣吃有效果不就行了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那可不行，我得記一下，再取點樣本回去，我那些做醫藥研發的同事一定會感興趣的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你有帶藥嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"治高原反應的？有啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我建議你看一下它的主要成分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（在行囊中一頓翻找）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"主要成分為......傍地酸漿果和泡沫果萃取物......難道說？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩米和哥倫比亞的主要貿易品之一就是醫藥原材料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽說你們那裡的公司在能夠人工製造醫藥成分或異地種植原材料後，便會把曾經的貿易夥伴一腳踢開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但很可惜，這種方法對薩米可行不通。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哥倫比亞連復原種植環境都做不到嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，哥倫比亞當然做得到。但就算復原環境，種下的植物也會有區別。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原因很簡單。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩米語）因為一切皆由薩米給予。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩米語）一切皆由薩米給予。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（磕磕絆絆的薩米語）一切......皆由薩米......給予？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你學語言學得還真快啊，我記得我們剛遇上的時候，你要想說點什麼和薩米有關的東西都得等西蒙娜給你翻譯一下呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的哥倫比亞語說得也很順暢啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是，艾爾啟懂得夠多，所以我多少也都會些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看到林地線了，山地人應該不會繼續找我們麻煩了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼，終於能吃頓好的了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有樹林就代表有好吃的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"山裡的肉還可以，但沒能吃的果子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"林子就不一樣了，想要什麼吃的都有哦~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（掏出筆記本記錄）“林地物產豐富......”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_iceforest_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"提豐，這裡附近有聚落嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有，而且是個有樹的部族。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那他們應該已經在這裡安寧地生活許多年了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有樹的部族？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"林地的部族有自己的族樹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......如果沒有，要麼是這個部族還太年輕，要麼是他們連自己的族樹都丟失了。無論哪種情況，都是該遭人恥笑的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個部族的人能溝通嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"印象裡還蠻和善的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且再怎麼說，住林地的都要比住山上的熱情好客吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，真的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"肯定的，那些山地的戰士一年四季都在應付北邊的怪物和不友好的烏薩斯人，脾氣壞點再正常不過了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有些戰士離開了陣線回到家鄉，臉色都沒那麼冷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那真是太好了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，薩米人一般是怎麼分的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很好記的，最北邊住在山裡的就是山地人，住在正中間林地和林地附近的就是林地人，住在最南邊沼澤地裡的就是澤地人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那提豐，你在這裡算什麼人呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我嗎？我是獵人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"獵人？但聽你剛剛的分類法，你不應該是住在什麼環境裡的人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——這個嘛......我是個薩卡茲，也沒什麼固定的住所和部族，自然也沒辦法用那套法子做區分啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那，西蒙娜姐呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她啊......她是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是羅德島人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島？那是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島在這裡也是一種分類嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算是吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們到了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"40_g5_samitribe"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚哇——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樹，就像是個......垂直的移動城市！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我從來沒見過——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——我得趕緊拍下來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡和之前相比好像沒什麼變化，不過——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們怎麼都在往外面搬東西？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林地薩滿","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩米語）歡迎你們的到來，朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩米語）感謝您的禮待，大樹侍者。我們從北邊來，想在這裡借宿一晚，您看可否行個方便？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林地薩滿","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩米語）當然可以，尊敬的薩滿，我們一向很樂意招待朋友。如果情況允許，你們的到來就足以用一場宴會來慶祝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林地薩滿","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩米語）但是很可惜，您也看到了，我們正在準備搬遷，離開這片久居的土地，就在明天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林地薩滿","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩米語）今晚樹上會有許多空屋，您和您的朋友可以選一間屋子歇息，大樹不會介意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩米語）感謝大樹與您部族的慷慨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林地薩滿","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩米語）不客氣，請進吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林地薩滿","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩米語）等您安頓下來後，請來我們樹頂的祖屋，有些事情需要借助您的智慧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（頷首）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們得到許可了，可以暫住一晚上。我們就住......靠近枝椏的那一間吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......終於有屋子可以住了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"屋子很重要嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在屋子裡睡覺才能安心啊，不然總是提心吊膽的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是這樣啊......還挺挑剔。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是挑剔啊，你聽我解釋——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_towerinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"防潮墊......睡袋......好了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？沒什麼啊，只是覺得你這樣為了睡覺忙活半天蠻好玩的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有時間好好睡一晚，肯定要弄得舒服點啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要不要睡睡看？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我？我用不著這樣的東西。只要袍子一裹，哪裡都可以睡啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"話是這麼說沒錯，但是——你試一下吧，躺在裡面眯一下，就知道為什麼了，很舒服的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"躺一會也不會少塊肉嘛，來呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘿咻......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鑽進去就行，我就不拉拉鏈了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔，好軟。和獸皮一樣......而且感覺更輕一些......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是今晚的口糧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好呀，謝謝。提豐的這份就先放在這邊吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我讓她試睡一下睡袋，結果她好像一下子就睡著了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我先離開一會，去和這裡的薩滿聊些事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想出門的話，最好讓提豐陪著你一起去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"林地人確實更好客，但要是你不懂規矩，他們會很生氣的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯嗯，我明白了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一路順風，西蒙娜姐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......提豐，提豐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她好像太累了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我就在門口拍幾張照......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_towerinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩米語）您找我有事？侍者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林地薩滿","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩米語）是的是的，太好了，您可算來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林地薩滿","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩米語）事情是這樣的，您應該也知道，我們正在準備遷徙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩米語）我們從山地過來時遇到過一些麻煩，這裡也有一樣的困擾嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林地薩滿","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩米語）確實，確實。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林地薩滿","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩米語）雖然還沒有人因此遭難，但關於各種不祥的徵兆，我的族人們已向我訴說了許多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林地薩滿","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩米語）最重要的是，這個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩米語）“克羅娜”，“芮瑟爾”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林地薩滿","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩米語）薩米的意志已經很明確了，無論出於何種考量，我族都該啟程，尋找更合適的家園。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩米語）我明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩米語）那您找我來是為了......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林地薩滿","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩米語）請看這個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩米語）不，不行。這是您族群的樹譜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩米語）我是個外人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林地薩滿","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩米語）我明白，朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林地薩滿","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩米語）我從小就生活在這片林地中，我的父親、祖父、祖輩們也是如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林地薩滿","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩米語）只是，我們已經安逸了太久，樹譜在我們這更像是一個象徵物，一種傳承。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林地薩滿","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩米語）當我翻開它時，我竟無法理解所有詞句。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林地薩滿","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩米語）我與我的家人們交流，與先祖們溝通，嘗試通曉所有符號的意義。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林地薩滿","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩米語）但我總覺得還差了些什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林地薩滿","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩米語）您也是一位薩滿，是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩米語）我曾經是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林地薩滿","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩米語）只要您曾經是，那麼您的智慧一定能夠幫到我們，朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林地薩滿","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩米語）請看吧，我們需要您的建議。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_towerinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"睡袋確實挺舒服的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麥哲倫！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奇怪......人呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"外面好像有點吵......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......“外鄉人”......“亂摸族樹”？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"完了，一定是那個呆頭羽！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"40_g5_samitribe"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......說話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起！我只知道樹不能取樣，真的不知道連摸都不能摸！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"族樹是整個部族最年長的、最受尊敬的對象，一般情況下異鄉人連住樹屋的機會都沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你會沒事摸你們的紀念碑或者......你們那裡有什麼很長壽又很有智慧的對象嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......總統先生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總統，好。如果你衝上去摸你們的總統，別人會有什麼反應？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可能還沒摸到就被旁邊的保鏢給制伏了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大概就是這個感覺吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡的人脾氣還可以，只是在背後數落你幾句，要是碰到民風彪悍的地方，真就一斧頭劈上來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"西蒙娜明明讓你出門一定記得要帶上我，你怎麼就忘了呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我本來只是想出門拍個照，覺得大樹先生材質很好想要近距離看看，就......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？你聽到西蒙娜姐的囑咐了？你不是，睡著了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我睡著也能聽得到啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那、那我叫你，你怎麼不起來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為我睡著了啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總之，記住這個教訓就行，別糾結了。你想吃些美味的果子嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡有嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看過了，林子裡有很多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，我們多摘些，給西蒙娜也準備點，明天路上還能吃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，嗯嗯！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_towerinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們回來了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"弄了些新鮮的果子，西蒙娜你吃嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯嗯嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"該休息了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麥哲倫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"提豐，你給她吃什麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是我啊，她自己採到了果子問我有沒有毒，我只說了沒毒，話還沒說完這糊塗蛋就把果子吃了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"閉口栗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就先休息，睡一覺就好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"晚安。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"晚安，西蒙娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯嗯嗯嗯嗯嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯嗯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"睡袋還是你睡吧，我不需要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希望你今晚能做個好夢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"麥哲倫還記得，自己的睡袋蓬鬆又暖和，耳邊還有兩個人勻稱的呼吸聲。\n那是個安靜、愜意、適合休息的環境。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"40_g1_blackforest"},{"type":"narration","text":"但當她睜開眼睛，她發現自己正在森林裡。\n植被漫過了自己的腰，樹木遮住月光，周圍一片漆黑。\n她感到口渴，於是她循著水流聲走到小溪邊，低下頭舔舐溪面。\n一切都是那麼理所應當，以至於見到水中的倒影，她也絲毫沒有察覺到異樣。\n即使水面倒映出來的——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"是一隻鼷獸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_603_1","isRemote":false,"text":"吱吱。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"夜色深沉，又安靜得可怕，麥哲倫本能地感受到危險。她趕緊俯下身子穿過草甸，爬上了那棵被分泌物標記過，可以被稱為家的巢穴。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_603_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘰嘰！"},{"type":"narration","text":"那裡是個安全的地方，那裡還有她的同族，她的家人。她站在樹枝上發出聲響，等待著回應。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"什麼都沒有。\n她有些猶豫，但還是跳上樹幹，回到了巢穴中。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"在那裡，她的母親沉在陰影中酣睡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她想要依偎在母親的懷抱中度過這個夜晚，但當雙眼適應了黑暗後，她才發現，那是一具殘缺不全的獸骨。\n巢穴很寬廣，也很黑暗，有什麼東西在等著她。\n等著她回到家園。\n等著她毫無防備。\n等著她被恐懼支配。\n......\n有什麼東西攀上了她的脖頸——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_towerinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_coldforest"},{"type":"narration","text":"剛剛的惡夢讓麥哲倫有些難受，她想出門喘口氣，平復下情緒後再回去休息。\n但當她走出門，眼前的景象讓她開始懷疑自己是否還沒從夢中醒來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一個巨大的陰影實體正在這個空間中遊蕩。\n看上去像人，又有些像樹，這個巨大的影子以一種緩慢而穩定的節奏向著一個方向前行。\n即使是高高在上的月亮，也被它所遮蔽，無法將光芒投至大地。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這......是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我得趕緊拍下來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"咔嚓——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎、怎麼可能，這不合常理啊？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"在麥哲倫拍下的照片中，影子並不存在，月光灑遍大地，一切都再正常不過了。\n但在麥哲倫眼中，那個陰影仍在移動。\n悄無聲息。\n麥哲倫愣在原地。\n她不知道自己是應該現在就回屋子裡睡覺，當這一切從來沒發生過......\n還是回房間取設備，嘗試測量這有可能無法留下有效記錄的靈異事件。\n就在她迷茫的時候，巨大的陰影掠過了她，她本能地向後一跳，與此同時——\n有什麼東西攀上了她的脖頸——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在這裡做什麼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，放鬆，麥哲倫，放輕鬆，有我在呢，這裡沒有東西會傷害你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......呼......啊......哈啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別急著說話，先緩一緩吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"坐下來，喝口水，不用管遠處那個大傢伙，它只是個影子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......呼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好點了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，謝謝，差點被你嚇死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你比我想的要堅強，我本來還期待著出現一聲吵醒所有人的尖叫呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我是不是今天晚上就要從村子裡被趕出去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不會不會，薩米人可沒那麼狹隘。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......做惡夢了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我猜猜，一個幼獸歸巢發現骸骨然後被捕食的夢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也做了同樣的夢嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，下午在睡袋裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是你的錯，當我在一個安全、輕鬆的環境裡休息時，它就會來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像個不受歡迎的朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩米就是這點不太好，即使是在夢裡，狩獵與被狩獵的循環還是不會停下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且大部分人在夢裡只能是獵物......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那，我們能成為獵手嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你難道不應該嘗試成為規則本身嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個應該不太可能吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰知道呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許可以吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我們變得更加成熟之後......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我們不再害怕這種大傢伙的時候。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣，麥哲倫，我們來摸摸它吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？那會不會很危險？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是探險家嗎，怎麼還會害怕？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我都是做好預案才出發的，但這個我真的不知道怎麼準備啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_coldforest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別、別拉我——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚啊啊，我們踩到樹了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這不是主幹，踩一下沒事的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再說了，這不是沒人盯著嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個位置不錯，我們就坐這吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"會、會不會太近了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不近點怎麼摸它呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的要......要碰嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這只是個影子，麥哲倫，沒什麼可怕的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或者說，它現在還只是個影子，很淺很淺的影子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也許有一天它會生長成更實際的威脅，但我們也在生長，我們會有更多的本領。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到了那個時候，也許這些東西對我們來說還是沒什麼可怕的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，在那個被捕食的夢裡，我有時候能聽到一個聲音。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“如果你被什麼東西嚇到了，那就立刻向它反擊。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“你戰勝了它，你就能戰勝恐懼；你從它面前逃走了，你就永遠害怕它。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可......"},{"type":"narration","text":"麥哲倫看著眼前帷幕般的陰影，心裡忐忑不安。\n夢中幻象的殘酷與壓迫感仍在她心頭縈繞。\n她心中感性的部分敦促她不要冒險，但——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她緩緩伸出了手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就這樣，慢慢來，不會有事的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也一起來吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"提豐把手心貼在麥哲倫的手背上，輕輕推動著。\n當感受到手上傳來的抗拒時，她就不繼續用力，而是繞過麥哲倫的手，直直向前。\n她將自己的手浸入陰影，抽出，而後重新放回麥哲倫的手背上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，沒什麼好怕的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我試試看......"},{"type":"narration","text":"麥哲倫的手一點、一點向前移動，直到她的指頭沒入陰影。\n她本以為會感受到涼意，或者會有什麼東西拖曳她，又或者啃噬她的手指。\n但沒有。\n什麼都沒有。\n先是一個指節，而後是一根手指，接下來是整個手掌。\n陰影仍在移動，但除了光影變化，什麼都沒有發生。\n就像提豐所說的那樣。\n這只是個影子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_coldforest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼樣，我說得沒錯吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"確實......什麼都沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......為什麼會出現這樣的情況呢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又開始糾結你的科學原理了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有東西是會平白無故發生的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那為什麼由母親生下的一定是你我，而非其他人呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"按你的說法，這難道不是“平白無故”嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這、這是因為......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"南方人好像還挺喜歡什麼事情都有個理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但對我來說，能夠隨時隨地面對未知可能更重要些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即便我沒有準備好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不會，害怕嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你會嗎？當你在冰原上面對暴風雪，在山間遇到雪崩，或者落單面對群獸的時候？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"會......但我想，我還能活下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算害怕，還能活著，你已經做到了最困難的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那還有什麼值得你害怕的呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算我們面前的影子，成為了真實存在的怪物，你也不會害怕吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為它實實在在，我們就能解決啊。可這只是個影子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"存在的東西就有弱點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等待，觀察，存活到發現弱點的那一刻，攻擊。獵手們都是這樣過來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是探險家，就勉強算半個獵手吧，也一定能對付這些東西的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有什麼是永恆不變的。或許有一天，你曾經害怕過的東西反而會畏懼你呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別想太多啦，明天還要趕路呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦對了，這個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"需要嗎，晚安水果？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用，晚上吃水果會長蛀牙的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，那隨你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"晚安。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"晚安，提豐。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"麥哲倫回過頭，再次與那徘徊的陰影對視。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"不知怎的，這一次，她不再覺得那是個代表恐懼與空無的陰影了。\n那更像是個不知所措的旅人，不知要往何處去，只是漫無目的地在大地上行走。\n或許，等到太陽升起的時候，它就會回到自己的屋子，美美睡上一覺吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"咔嚓——\n麥哲倫又拍了一張照，裡面依舊什麼都沒有。\n她想了想，為這張照片添加了一個備註："},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“孤獨先生”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"最終，一切又歸於寂靜。\n只留下彷徨的陰影獨自遊蕩。\n直至天明。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"40_g5_samitribe"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"應該差不多到時候了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道這究竟是做什麼的儀式呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噢哦，開始了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（掏出筆記本記錄）“薩米人的儀式以他們圍著大樹唱歌跳舞為開端。或許是為了與大樹告別。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"十分鐘後"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“舞蹈很有特色，但沒規律，每個人都在跳自己的。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“就像是在狂歡。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"半小時後"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（打哈欠）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"西蒙娜還沒來嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，她還在大樹下面，和薩滿說話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想看的話，我可以借你望遠鏡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"眼睛就夠了，用不著你的機器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"提豐，這到底是個什麼儀式？他們還要花多久？要不是你過來了，我都要睡著啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是個薩米薩卡茲，不是薩米埃拉菲亞，知道的不比你多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至於會持續多久，那就不好說了。我見過薩滿點個頭就結束的儀式，也見過從早至晚徹夜不停的聚會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別管什麼儀式了，先來看看這個，我剛在林子裡找到的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是......雪球？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安瑪的愛！麥哲倫，這是安瑪的愛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安瑪？老媽媽？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你記得可真快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"用你們的話來說，這個東西確實被稱作老媽媽的愛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它是薩米人最渴望獲得的庇護，在薩米的諸多仁慈中，它是最純淨與真善的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"送你了，麥哲倫，把它放在口袋裡就行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你剛剛說，這是薩米人最想要得到的東西吧。是你找到它的，我不能收。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我太清楚它的價值了，就是因為這個，我沒有資格擁有它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安瑪不喜歡庇佑貪婪的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而你對她一無所知，無知也是純淨，再加上你有一個真摯的靈魂，把它交給你才是最合適的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我......接下來要做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"忘了它的存在，就當你從未獲得過它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我一定得給你一個回禮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請等一下......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來，送你這個，小颱風。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你叫我什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......算了。這是什麼東西？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"照明燃燒棒，扭開蓋子，拉上面的繩子，就可以發出很大的響聲和光亮。你是獵人，肯定知道什麼時候能用到這個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽上去還挺有用，下次試試看。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，麥哲倫，他們不跳了。你不是要記錄嗎，快記！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？啊！好的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（掏出筆記本記錄）“在持續四十分鐘的非集體性狂歡後，儀式進入了下一個階段。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“薩滿向族人們展示了一塊木刻。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“說著一些激昂的話。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“接著，她高舉木杖，面向大樹吹響號角，然後開始念叨著什麼。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“有一位薩滿從旁輔助，像是在伴唱。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"提豐，你能幫忙聽聽她在說什麼嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽不懂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"語調很熟悉，但是明顯不是平常說話會用的詞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（記錄）“某種祭祀用語。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幾個短句在不斷重複。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“重複......”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“不斷堆疊情緒，聲響不斷增大——”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎、怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"地震了？提豐我們要去哪裡避難？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是的......麥哲倫......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，樹......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩卡茲語）天啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"大樹拔出根系，從大地上緩緩起身。\n轟鳴之聲響徹天際，眾人的嘯叫與呼喊被盡數壓過。\n它越過周邊的林地，慢慢抬升，一邊穩定自己的身形，一邊將根系擰在一起，組成一種見所未見的——用人類的話來說——運動結構。\n樹葉從樹冠上灑落，但薩米人並沒有受到驚嚇，反而顯得十分興奮。\n確實，有什麼能夠比看著承載歲月、歷史與回憶的祖靈之樹拔地而起更令人振奮的呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_iceforest_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩米語）恭喜您，侍者，儀式成功了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林地薩滿","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩米語）我一直以為祖輩們所說的與大樹同行只是典籍中的故事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林地薩滿","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩米語）謝謝您，寒檀木的後裔，沒有您的幫助與解讀，這場喚醒儀式就不會如此順利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林地薩滿","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩米語）大樹甦醒了，但它還在等待方向與行動的建議，我得再鑽研一下樹譜的內容......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩米語）像大樹這樣明顯的軀殼，北方災異是不會錯過的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩米語）它們近期的行動越來越頻繁了，您一定要祈求薩米與您一同護佑大樹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林地薩滿","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩米語）是，是，您說得對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩米語）還請儘快向南方去，並讓大樹重新扎根，不要被它們纏上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林地薩滿","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩米語）我知道了。唔......樹譜上說......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩米語）那麼，我和我的同伴就此離開了。願薩米為您的部族找一個好去處，讓您的族人不再遭受流遷之苦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林地薩滿","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩米語）啊，您要走了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩米語）您還有諸多事務要處理，不用遠送了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林地薩滿","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩米語）那就祝福你們前路無憂。再次感謝您的幫助，尊貴的朋友......哦......原來如此，要讓大樹起步應當......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩米語）再會。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"匯報。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（模仿烏薩斯信使的聲音）我已按照計劃進入薩米。請告知“列巴羽”和“黑印”位置，完畢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"西蒙娜姐，西蒙娜姐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我回來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有什麼我能幫忙的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"該出發了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起，耽誤了點時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"沒事的，我們走吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"西蒙娜姐，你一會一定得和我解釋一下那個儀式裡到底說了點什麼，這對我的研究來說很重要的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我們邊走邊說。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好欸。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒什麼，馬上就好！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"咔嚓——\n臨行前，麥哲倫拍了一張站起身子、佇立在森林中的大樹。\n不知怎的，她覺得這幾近遮蔽太陽的巨物，有著似曾相識的輪廓——\n但她沒有多想，只是將這一瞬間的念頭隨手記在了筆記本上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"隨後，她就跟上了隊伍，繼續向著薩米南部進發。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
